UnitRegistry
├── when resolving a chain ID to a key
│   ├── given the chain ID is in a registry file
│   │   └── it returns the key
│   └── given the chain ID is in no registry file
│       └── it reverts with UnknownChainId
├── when reading an address entry
│   ├── given the entry exists
│   │   └── it returns the address from the JSON
│   └── given the entry or the file is absent
│       └── it reverts with EntryNotFound naming both
├── when parsing the CCIP selector
│   ├── given a decimal string within uint64
│   │   └── it returns the value
│   ├── given a non numeric or empty or oversized string
│   │   └── it reverts with InvalidSelector
│   └── given the registry has no selector
│       └── it reverts with EntryNotFound
└── when the project grants file access
    └── it allows no write to the registry directory
